WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Set up V.O.I.C.E. for your child.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
The first screen asks three things.
You can change all of them later.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.300
Who you are, the learner’s name,
and the board.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Who you are. “Parent or caregiver”
shows the everyday settings.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.800
“Clinician or teacher” adds teaching
sessions and data.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.500
The learner’s name.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.300
This is optional.

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.600
The board: 24 buttons, large buttons
for early skills, starts with 6 words.

9
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.000
45 buttons is the standard board.

10
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.400
Choose the option that starts with 6 words
and reveals more as the learner grows.

11
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.600
84 buttons is a larger board
with smaller buttons.

12
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.400
Not sure which board? Ask your child’s
speech-language pathologist or behavior analyst.

13
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.400
Choose a 4-digit passcode.

14
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.200
It opens the adult menu. To get there,
hold the small circle for 3 seconds,

15
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.600
then enter the passcode.

16
00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
